\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  guideline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  example</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AnnotationExample</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>评估标准的设计需要针对不同查询类型进行差异化。导航型查询的 &quot;完美匹配&quot; 是目标页面本身；信息型查询的 &quot;完美匹配&quot; 是完整准确回答问题的内容；交易型查询的 &quot;完美匹配&quot; 是包含价格、可购买链接的商品页面。人工标注产出的分级相关性标签，正是<a href=\"offline-metrics\">离线评估指标</a>中 NDCG、MAP 等指标的计算输入——标注质量直接封顶了离线评估的可信度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评估员管理与质量控制\">评估员管理与质量控制</h2><p>人工评估的质量高度依赖评估员的能力和一致性。需要通过培训、校准和质量监控机制确保标注结果的可靠性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface AnnotatorMetrics {&#10;  annotatorId: string;&#10;  interAnnotatorAgreement: number;&#10;  goldAccuracy: number;&#10;  completionRate: number;&#10;  avgTime: number;&#10;  flaggedCount: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface QualityControlConfig {&#10;  goldRatio: number;&#10;  overlapRatio: number;&#10;  minAgreementKappa: number;&#10;  maxAnnotationTime: number;&#10;  minAnnotationTime: number;&#10;  rejectThreshold: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function calculateKappa(annotatorA: number[], annotatorB: number[], numLabels: number): number {&#10;  const n = annotatorA.length;&#10;  let observed = 0;&#10;  const countA = new Array(numLabels).fill(0);&#10;  const countB = new Array(numLabels).fill(0);&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;    if (annotatorA[i] === annotatorB[i]) observed++;&#10;    countA[annotatorA[i]]++;&#10;    countB[annotatorB[i]]++;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const po = observed / n;&#10;  let pe = 0;&#10;  for (let k = 0; k &lt; numLabels; k++) {&#10;    pe += (countA[k] / n) * (countB[k] / n);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return (po - pe) / (1 - pe);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function qualityCheck(&#10;  annotations: Map&lt;string, number[]&gt;,&#10;  goldLabels: Map&lt;string, number&gt;,&#10;  config: QualityControlConfig,&#10;): AnnotatorMetrics[] {&#10;  const metrics: AnnotatorMetrics[] = [];&#10;&#10;  for (const [annotatorId, labels] of annotations) {&#10;    let goldCorrect = 0;&#10;    let goldTotal = 0;&#10;&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; labels.length; i++) {&#10;      const gold = goldLabels.get(`item_${i}`);&#10;      if (gold !== undefined) {&#10;        goldTotal++;&#10;        if (labels[i] === gold) goldCorrect++;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    metrics.push({&#10;      annotatorId,&#10;      interAnnotatorAgreement: 0,&#10;      goldAccuracy: goldTotal &gt; 0 ? goldCorrect / goldTotal : 0,&#10;      completionRate: 1.0,&#10;      avgTime: 0,&#10;      flaggedCount: 0,&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return metrics;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AnnotatorMetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  annotatorId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  interAnnotatorAgreement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><spa